WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Check, check, microphone, check, check.

00:05.860 --> 00:07.920
Checkity, check, check, check, check, check, check.

00:11.580 --> 00:14.420
Microphone, are you on?

00:14.420 --> 00:14.820
Okay.

